  <running_head>INSTITUTIONUM</running_head>
  <main_text>
    <l n="1">ventur: an extra mineram confiftant.</l>
    <l n="2">Porro an debitam confiftentiam &amp; per-</l>
    <l n="3">fectionem acquisiverint, an nondum.</l>
    <l n="4">Item an singuli sejunctim, an utrique</l>
    <l n="5">q. pro uno principio stantes, generent.</l>
    <l n="6">Rursus: an in confistentia &amp; magnitu-</l>
    <l n="7">dine sua permaneant, an mutentur &amp;</l>
    <l n="8">imminuantur? Et quæ plura <i>1.</i>Si quid</l>
    <l n="9">probabile dici possit, omnino arbitror</l>
    <l n="10">adamantes cum sua minera esse effossos</l>
    <l n="11">&amp; ex illa juxta illos priores adamantes</l>
    <l n="12">alios adamantes producstos:ita quidem</l>
    <l n="13">ut arbitrer, illis quoque adamantibus</l>
    <l n="14">remotis novos progigni potuisse. Ita</l>
    <l n="15">enim observatum est in mineris omni-</l>
    <l n="16">bus mineralibus erutis, tamen nova</l>
    <l n="17">suo tempore reperta esse.</l>
    <l n="18" type="heading" level="2" para="true">III. <i>Vt autem viventium generatio-</i>
    </l>
    <l n="19" type="heading" level="2">
      <i>nem explicatius intelligamus,id tenendum</i>
    </l>
    <l n="20" type="heading" level="2">
      <i>est solere eam in univocam &amp; æquivocam</i>
    </l>
    <l n="21" type="heading" level="2">
      <i>dividi, atque de ea utraque seorsim agen-</i>
    </l>
    <l n="22" type="heading" level="2">
      <i>dum esse.</i>
    </l>
    <l n="23" para="true">§. De hac generationis divifione</l>
    <l n="24">multa explicanda sunt, attamen cum pecu-</l>
    <l n="25">liaria ea fere sint, circa particularem</l>
    <l n="26">corporum explicationem ea enodabi-</l>
    <l n="27">mus: hoc solum notandum est: quod</l>
    <l n="28">
      <i>univoca generatio</i> etiam soleat dici <i>ex</i>
    </l>
    <l n="29">
      <i>femine &amp; æquivoca spontanea:</i> non quod</l>
    <l n="30">hæc non habeat quoq; aliquid femina-</l>
    <l n="31">le, aut</l>
